{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Shot</strong> is a fast-paced physics puzzle game that tests both your reflexes and your mind.<br>Inside a glowing digital maze, your goal is to <strong>pull, aim, and launch</strong> a small neon square with precision. Reaching the target may look simple, but every shot and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time, outsmart cleverly designed obstacles, and conquer each level with skill and strategy. With <strong>intuitive controls</strong>, <strong>deep mechanics</strong>, and a striking neon aesthetic, Neon Shot blends the spirit of classic arcades with modern physics-based gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick &amp; Launch Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Pull, aim, release. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Gravity, friction, ramps, barriers, and more across handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Every second counts. Beat the level, then beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Atmosphere &amp; Synthwave Style</strong> \u2013 Retro-futuristic visuals meet electronic soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill + Strategy Balance</strong> \u2013 Limited shots and unusual solutions encourage creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocking</strong> \u2013 Each victory opens the next challenge, with difficulty ramping up step by step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Join Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By jumping in today, you\u2019ll get access to all current content <strong>plus every future update for free</strong>.<br>Your feedback will directly shape the game\u2019s evolution \u2014 be part of the <strong>Neon Shot</strong> community from the very beginning.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level-1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/9844d9d0764437e2d07acf867e460a9bf56ad9d6.jpg"},{"name":"Level-2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/71c36fc4983f7c1dcb7f292c6efaf92858ead4f6.jpg"},{"name":"Level-3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/f509b9b261a3c9a52917e67753589669878287a0.jpg"},{"name":"Level-4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/d2516a9c206150eb6236af9ddcc4d67f1262dc5e.jpg"},{"name":"Level-5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/6b302976cdd80459f0a5016c0dfcc57fa86d0ed8.jpg"},{"name":"Level-6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/0b1a7717abbfebd8fb9b0595b9f1ef8ac4f02f2e.jpg"},{"name":"Level-7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/07f23e7c3ec912c45c462ed7ddf7b2cdea6561bb.jpg"},{"name":"Level-8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/e2e77231d78c2faec315c6ae0ffdc24ad9abdbc9.jpg"},{"name":"Level-9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/355c657ce8c5d5ce5a6c7ec5eb8104de73693d6b.jpg"},{"name":"Level-10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910560/9d06f93bab653a5ac5d068de122d93f21afc34c2.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910560?t=1757463703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910560?t=1757463703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910560/f197badd2f86800999caadb1cfadf0b5da37d523/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757463703","capsule_imagev5