lve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack DLC</strong> \u2013 A standalone synthwave music pack</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Shot</strong> is a fast-paced physics puzzle game that tests both your reflexes and your mind.<br>Inside a glowing digital maze, your goal is to <strong>pull, aim, and launch</strong> a small neon square with precision. Reaching the target may look simple, but every shot and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time, outsmart cleverly designed obstacles, and conquer each level with skill and strategy. With <strong>intuitive controls</strong>, <strong>deep mechanics</strong>, and a striking neon aesthetic, Neon Shot blends the spirit of classic arcades with modern physics-based gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick &amp; Launch Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Pull, aim, release. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Gravity, friction, ramps, barriers, and more across handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Every second counts. Beat the level, then beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Atmosphere &amp; Synthwave Style</strong> \u2013 Retro-futuristic visuals meet electronic soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill + Strategy Balance</strong> \u2013 Limited shots and unusual solutions encourage creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocking</strong> \u2013 Each victory opens the next challenge, with difficulty ramping up step by step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Join Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By jumping in today, you\u2019ll get access to all current content <strong>plus every future update for free</strong>.<br>Your feedback will directly shape the game\u2019s evolution \u2014 be part of the <strong>Neon Shot</strong> community from the very beginning.</p>","developers":["cnsgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910560/25d9e0ceb4e83538c51180215f0da5b5be7d181f/header.jpg?t=1757463703","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3910560/916489815/9a7684f5830ebdeafe921d1a7e438d8b5a5c3e4a/1754394250/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754395985","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3910560/916489815/9a7684f5830ebdeafe921d1a7e438d8b5a5c3e4a/1754394250/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754395985","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3910560/916489815/9a7684f5830ebdeafe921d1a7e438d8b5a5c3e4a/1754394250/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754395985","id":257174997,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174997/movie480.mp4?t=1754395985","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174997/movie_max.mp4?t=1754395985"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174997/89f829fc7fad249f5b20fb8e44b9fd1001a686f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754395985","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174997/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754395985","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174997/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754395985"}}],"name":"Neon Shot","package_groups":[{"description":"",